OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFriday will start wet with some
OL,6,Fheavy rain around, coupled with breezy
OL,7,Fconditions at times. Skies will
OL,8,Fbrighten from the northwest through
OL,9,Fthe morning, leaving sunny spells and
OL,10,Fisolated showers in the afternoon.
OL,11,FStaying breezy, and feeling fresher
OL,12,Fthan recently.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThe odd shower may affect
OL,15,Fnorth Wales overnight, but most places
OL,16,Fwill be dry and there will be clear
OL,17,Fperiods. Winds easing, and turning
OL,18,Fchilly in some rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
